	(text_box "設計メモ\nU3Cの出力が5Vのとき、D2のIF≦(5-3.3)/10k=0.17mA\nonsemi BAT54SLはIF=1mAでVF=0.32V(max)\nしたがってmic_out≦3.3+0.32V\nU8(TC74HC4051AF)のIO入力定格-0.5V～VCC+0.5Vを満たす。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 166.37 31.75 0)
		(size 49.53 12.226)
